  "toolboxDefectsNotToCopy": [
    "Original VTXMSP uses false-as-absent fallback for PIToff; native TBS PIToff without changed power has no independent command path. Bytecode evidence,not hardwareverified.",
    "MSPRST cancels queue but does not clear setInP/eSave; final write timeout may leave pending indicators. Target must handle failure explicitly.",
    "INAV GPS scheduler tests GPS_ON whereas BF tests MDL_GPS_ON; alias/execution must be verified before treating INAV detailed sats as proven hardwareworking.",
    "VTX_FRQ_RANGE is shown/saved but no runtime consumer found in recovered-source whole-tree search; no original consumer claim.",
    "INAV reference catalogue repeats same tuples for Save and Unload waypoint mission; validate against supported official INAV before porting."
  ],
